A dead simple WebGPU program: just clear a canvas to a colour. We ask the browser for an adapter (the physical GPU) and a device (a handle to it). Tell the canvas context to use that device. Then set up commands with an encoder, run them in a render pass that just clears the canvas texture, and submit it.


